IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `carer-types`
IMPORT `carer-rules`

-- Carer Recognition Act 2010 (Cth) — the encoder's tests.

§ `Tests`

GIVEN nd IS A `Need for care`, bs IS A `Basis of care`, bd IS A `Kind of body`
GIVETH A `Carer case`
`caring for` nd `on the basis` bs `with` bd MEANS `Carer case` OF TRUE, nd, bs, bd

#ASSERT `I am a carer under the Act` (`caring for` `a disability` `on the basis` `informally` `with` `another body`)
#ASSERT `I am a carer under the Act` (`caring for` `a mental illness` `on the basis` `informally` `with` `another body`)
#ASSERT `I am a carer under the Act` (`caring for` `being frail and aged` `on the basis` `informally` `with` `another body`)
#ASSERT `I am a carer under the Act` (`caring for` `a medical condition, including a terminal or chronic illness` `on the basis` `informally` `with` `another body`)
#ASSERT NOT (`I am a carer under the Act` (`caring for` `none of these` `on the basis` `informally` `with` `another body`))
#ASSERT NOT (`I am a carer under the Act` (`caring for` `a disability` `on the basis` `under a contract of service or for services` `with` `another body`))
#ASSERT NOT (`I am a carer under the Act` (`caring for` `a disability` `on the basis` `voluntary work for a charitable, welfare or community organisation` `with` `another body`))
#ASSERT NOT (`I am a carer under the Act` (`caring for` `a disability` `on the basis` `as part of a course of education or training` `with` `another body`))
-- s 5(3): a relative who gives no care is not a carer.
#ASSERT NOT (`I am a carer under the Act` (`Carer case` OF FALSE, `a disability`, `informally`, `another body`))

#ASSERT `the body must consult carers for` (`caring for` `a disability` `on the basis` `informally` `with` `a public service care agency`)
#ASSERT NOT (`the body must consult carers for` (`caring for` `a disability` `on the basis` `informally` `with` `another public service agency`))
#ASSERT NOT (`the body must consult carers for` (`caring for` `a disability` `on the basis` `informally` `with` `an associated provider`))
#ASSERT `the body must make its staff aware of the Statement for` (`caring for` `a disability` `on the basis` `informally` `with` `another public service agency`)
#ASSERT `the body must make its staff aware of the Statement for` (`caring for` `a disability` `on the basis` `informally` `with` `an associated provider`)
#ASSERT NOT (`the body must make its staff aware of the Statement for` (`caring for` `a disability` `on the basis` `informally` `with` `another body`))
#ASSERT `the body must reflect the Statement in care supports for` (`caring for` `a disability` `on the basis` `informally` `with` `an associated provider`)
#ASSERT NOT (`the body must reflect the Statement in care supports for` (`caring for` `a disability` `on the basis` `informally` `with` `another public service agency`))

#ASSERT (`the carer position for` (`caring for` `a disability` `on the basis` `informally` `with` `a public service care agency`))'s `I am a carer`
#ASSERT NOT ((`the carer position for` (`caring for` `a disability` `on the basis` `informally` `with` `a public service care agency`))'s `I can enforce these obligations`)
#ASSERT NOT ((`the carer position for` (`caring for` `a disability` `on the basis` `informally` `with` `a public service care agency`))'s `non-compliance invalidates a decision`)
